WEBVTT

00:30:59.650 --> 00:31:01.680
He was a force, or is a force.

00:31:02.591 --> 00:31:04.594
AG: When I think about a personal trainer,

00:31:04.618 --> 00:31:05.831
my first reaction is,

00:31:05.855 --> 00:31:08.292
OK, this is somebody
who is going to pump me up.

00:31:08.316 --> 00:31:11.874
My second thought is,
when I bring in a personal trainer,

00:31:11.898 --> 00:31:15.071
it's somebody who's trying
to help me achieve my own goals.

00:31:15.095 --> 00:31:18.286
So I'm trying to get in shape
or get faster or stronger,

00:31:18.310 --> 00:31:20.437
or lose weight,
whatever the target may be,

00:31:20.461 --> 00:31:22.722
that person is there to help me.

00:31:23.186 --> 00:31:25.588
And I wonder if that analogy breaks down

00:31:25.612 --> 00:31:28.013
when you start to think
of a founder and CEO

00:31:28.037 --> 00:31:32.146
who may not be there to try
to help the people around him?